1	# openvela UI native shell
2	
3	This directory is the isolated native LVGL implementation of the smart-band
4	reference under `openvela_ui/smart-band-ui-redesign`. The reference project is
5	read-only: its Quick App source is not compiled into this application.
6	
7	The native shell implements the six-page circular trunk:
8	
9	```text
10	Home <-> Weather <-> Sport <-> Health <-> Music <-> Notifications <-> Home
11	```
12	
13	AI Assistant is intentionally excluded. Swipe down on Home to open Appearance,
14	then choose Background or Action. Swipe up to return. The five background
15	themes and six cat actions use the reference assets, while the native UI keeps
16	two shared `lv_image` objects and only builds paths for the selected action.
17	The two images cross-fade adjacent source frames on a 16/17/17 ms cadence,
18	averaging 60 visual updates per second while preserving every action's original
19	cycle duration and authored hold timing. The timer pauses while a full-screen
20	module is open, so the extra blending work is limited to the visible cat region.
21	The Appearance flow is a full-screen overlay, so vertical navigation does not
22	compete with the horizontal TileView.
23	
24	Runtime assets are isolated below the configured data root:
25	
26	```text
27	backgrounds/  five 432x514 themes
28	actions/      five additional frame sequences
29	cat/          default cover-dance sequence
30	icons/        primary-page markers
31	music/        player icons and 24 kHz mono S16LE PCM tracks
32	```
33	
34	Music playback uses NxPlayer directly with `/dev/audio/pcm0p`; it does not
35	require `mediad`.  `deploy_assets.sh` converts the reference MP3 tracks to raw
36	PCM with GStreamer before pushing them, matching the files carried by the
37	R528 board images.  The host therefore needs `gst-launch-1.0` together with
38	the `mpegaudioparse` and `mpg123audiodec` plugins.
39	
40	Enable `CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_OPENVELA_UI`, build the image, start the emulator,
41	then deploy runtime assets:
42	
43	```sh
44	./packages/demos/openvela_ui/deploy_assets.sh /path/to/smart-band-ui-redesign
45	adb shell 'openvela_ui &'
46	```
